ent-FoodBowlBase = { ent-SolutionSmall }
    .desc = { ent-SolutionSmall.desc }
ent-FoodSoupPea = 豌豆湯 | pea soup
    .desc = 一道樸實無華的豌豆湯。 | A humble split pea soup.
ent-FoodSaladAesir = 阿斯加德沙拉 | aesir salad
    .desc = 這大概太不可思議了，凡人恐怕難以盡情領略。 | Probably too incredible for mortals to fully enjoy.
ent-FoodSaladHerb = 香草沙拉 | herb salad
    .desc = 一道頂部鋪有蘋果的美味沙拉。 | A tasty salad with apples on top.
ent-FoodSaladValid = 合規沙拉 | valid salad
