ent-FoodSaladKimchi = 泡菜沙拉 | kimchi salad
    .desc = 這真的只是一道辛辣的沙拉罷了。 | It really is just a spicy salad.
ent-FoodSaladFruit = 水果沙拉 | fruit salad
    .desc = 一道標準的水果沙拉。 | Your standard fruit salad.
ent-FoodSaladJungle = 叢林沙拉 | jungle salad
