ent-FoodSaladCitrus = 柑橘沙拉 | citrus salad
    .desc = 柑橘大爆發！ | Citrus overload!
ent-FoodSaladEden = 伊甸園沙拉 | salad of eden
    .desc = 一道蘊藏著無限潛力的沙拉。 | A salad brimming with untapped potential.
ent-FoodRiceBoiled = 白飯 | boiled rice
    .desc = 一碗熱騰騰的米飯。 | A warm bowl of rice.
