ent-FoodJellyDuff = 斯佩斯·利伯蒂·達夫 | space liberty duff
    .desc = 《Jello 吉利丁》，摘自阿爾弗雷德·哈伯德的食譜書。 | Jello gelatin, from Alfred Hubbard's cookbook.
ent-FoodJellyAmanita = 毒蘑菇果凍 | amanita jelly
    .desc = 這東西很邪惡，千萬別碰！ | It's evil, don't touch it!
ent-FoodSoupMeatball = 肉丸湯 | meatball soup
    .desc = 小子，你真有種，真有種啊！ | You've got balls kid, BALLS!
ent-FoodSoupSlime = 黏液湯 | slime soup
    .desc = 如果沒有水，你可以用眼淚來代替。 | If no water is available, you may substitute tears.
ent-FoodSoupTomatoBlood = 番茄湯 | tomato soup
