ent-FoodSoupMiso = 味噌湯 | miso soup
    .desc = 這湯鹹鹹的、帶有魚腥味，最適合搭配拉麵享用。 | Salty, fishy soup, best had with ramen.
ent-FoodSoupMushroom = 蘑菇湯 | mushroom soup
    .desc = 一道美味又飽足的蘑菇湯。 | A delicious and hearty mushroom soup.
ent-FoodSoupBeet = 甜菜湯 | beet soup
    .desc = 等等，這個詞到底該怎麼拼來著……？ | Wait, how do you spell it again..?
ent-FoodSoupBeetRed = 紅甜菜湯 | red beet soup
    .desc = 真是道美味佳餚。 | Quite a delicacy.
ent-FoodSoupStew = 燉菜 | stew
